---
import Container from "../Container.astro";
import SectionHeading from "../SectionHeading.astro";
import Avatar from "../Avatar.astro";
---

<Container background="tint">
	<SectionHeading title="Co-host" id="co-host" />
	<div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row gap-8 items-start mt-6">
		<Avatar src="/images/rvilla.jpg" alt="Rosa Villa" />
		<div class="prose flex-1">
			<p>
				I'll occasionally be joined by <a href="https://www.rosavilla.me/">Rosa Villa</a>, a
				psychologist with two PhDs, licensed therapist and founder of the executive coaching and
				consulting firm <a href="https://www.lumisisgroup.com/">Lumisis Group</a>.
			</p>
			<p>
				Rosa has been working with groups for several years and is currently taking part in the
				<a href="https://timelesswisdomtraining.com/">Timeless Wisdom Training</a>, an intensive
				two-year program offered by Thomas Huebl.
			</p>
			<p>
				It'll be visible from the calendar and the invitation for which sessions Rosa is joining.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</Container>
